{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "cap-btitle",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -2100,
   "y": -560,
   "width": 1500,
   "height": 170,
   "text": "# Inkling — one decoder layer  \nA sliding-window MoE layer (L2–4, L6–10, …; 53 of 66). Grey bars = tensors (0.05 px/channel, long ones clipped), boxes = operations with their weights per layer (checkpoint name, transformers name). Read top → bottom; the four middle columns run side by side."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-bnote",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -500,
   "y": -560,
   "width": 1500,
   "height": 170,
   "text": "**Layer variants.** 11 *global* layers (L5, L11, … L65): 8 KV heads (wk/wv 6144→1024), no window, relative bias over 1024 distances, log-scaled queries (119.6M attention). L0–1: dense SwiGLU 6144→24576→6144 × global_scale (453.0M) instead of the MoE. Norms, short-convs and residuals are identical everywhere."
  },
  {
   "id": "bx65",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -154,
   "y": -330,
   "width": 307,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl66",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 174,
   "y": -342,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`x [T, 6144] from previous layer`"
  },
  {
   "id": "bn167",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -150,
   "y": -281,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**RMSNorm** (attn_norm)",
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "bxn68",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -154,
   "y": -185,
   "width": 307,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl69",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 174,
   "y": -197,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`x̂ [T, 6144]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "rp70",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1900,
   "y": -76,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**wr_du** (r_proj) 6144 → 64×16  \n6.3M",
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "rt71",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1776,
   "y": 20,
   "width": 51,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl72",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -2220,
   "y": 8,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`r [T, 64, 16]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "rl73",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1900,
   "y": 69,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "**rel_logits_proj**: r_h · P (16×512)  \none bias per head per distance  \n8.2K",
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "rb74",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1990,
   "y": 189,
   "width": 480,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl75",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -2310,
   "y": 177,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`bias [T, 64, 512 distances]` — bar clipped (real 1638px)"
  },
  {
   "id": "rg76",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1900,
   "y": 238,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 72,
   "text": "**gather by distance** q−k  \n0 beyond 512",
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "qp77",
   "type": "text",
