   "y": 928,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`h [T, 6144]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "bn2106",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -150,
   "y": 989,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**RMSNorm** (mlp_norm)",
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "hn107",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -154,
   "y": 1085,
   "width": 307,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl108",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -474,
   "y": 1073,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`ĥ [T, 6144]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "rt109",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -150,
   "y": 1134,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "**router** 6144→256+2, sigmoid · top-6 of 256 by score+bias  \n1.6M",
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "shexp",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 420,
   "y": 1134,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "**2 shared experts** (always on)    \nSwiGLU 6144→3072→6144 each    \n113.2M",
   "color": "#22c55e"
  },
  {
   "id": "rid110",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -20,
   "y": 1254,
   "width": 40,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl111",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 170,
   "y": 1242,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`6 expert ids + 6+2 weights / token`"
  },
  {
   "id": "rw112",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -150,
   "y": 1303,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "**weights**: softmax of log σ over the 6 picked  \n+ 2 shared logits, × 8 × global_scale",
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "rex113",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -150,
   "y": 1423,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "**6 of 256 routed experts**, each SwiGLU 6144→3072→6144  \n56.6M · each · 14.50B all",
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "sum114",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -150,
   "y": 1543,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**Σ** weighted routed + shared experts",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "mo115",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -154,
   "y": 1639,
   "width": 307,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl116",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 174,
   "y": 1627,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`[T, 6144]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "msc117",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -150,
   "y": 1688,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "**mlp_sconv**: causal depthwise, kernel 4  \n+ its own input (fp32)  \n24.6K",
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r2118",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -150,
   "y": 1808,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**+ residual**",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "bout119",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -154,
   "y": 1904,
   "width": 307,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl120",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 174,
   "y": 1892,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`x [T, 6144] → next layer`"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-pos",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1900,
   "y": 550,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 210,
   "text": "**No RoPE.** Each token's r vector mixes a learned bank of bias-vs-distance profiles (P), so every head adds its own content-dependent bias to the last 512 keys (1024 in global layers). q and k are RMS-normalised per head, hence the 1/128 scale instead of 1/√128."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-sink",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 820,
   "y": 930,
   "width": 520,
   "height": 190,
   "text": "**Shared-expert sink.** The router has 258 rows: the 2 shared experts are scored with the routed ones, and the 6+2 picked weights are normalised together, so a token can lean on the shared experts or on its routed picks. e_score_correction_bias (mlp.gate.bias) only steers which experts get picked."
  }
 ],
